	(text "DESIGN NOTES:\n1. Board distributes power for one panel column (six branches of 56 LEDs).\n2. U1 is TI PTH12060WAH, configured for regulated 5.0 V output.\n3. F1 and F2-F7 are starting values only; confirm from measured operating/inrush current.\n4. Use 2 oz copper, broad +5V/GND pours, short high-current paths, and 2.0 mm FR-4.\n5. D1 must be selected/rated for full input current; an ideal-diode MOSFET stage may replace it.\n6. Verify every connector polarity against actual harness before assembly.\n7. Board outline is 300 mm x 100 mm; confirm hinge and cable clearance before fabrication."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(thickness 0.3556)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a1f9bc48-d952-4af8-823c-4e1b9847f81b")
	)
